src/platform/detmath/detmath.cpp is a port of the GameCube game's libm (SN Systems ngc libm.a), which is
newlib's single-precision fdlibm (ef_*.c, sf_*.c, kf_*.c). Its sources carry this notice:

  Conversion to float by Ian Lance Taylor, Cygnus Support, ian@cygnus.com.

